SCOPE AND ATTRIBUTION.

This repository is a derivative work of TamaPoke by Quique Tortosa
(https://github.com/socquique/TamaPoke), used under the MIT License.

Substantial parts of Sources/ are direct translations of that project's C++
into Swift and Objective-C++ -- notably the scene renderer, the idle-screen
layout and input handling, the UI palette and layout constants, and the
status-string logic. Those portions remain (c) Quique Tortosa, and the MIT
terms above apply to them as they do to the rest.

upstream/ is a git submodule: this repository stores only a commit reference,
no copied files. Its own LICENSE governs its contents.

